## Model card

- **Name:** Muse Wonder Full
- **Short description:** Meta positions Muse Wonder Full as its most advanced model in the Muse Wonder series for frontier coding, long-running agents, and advanced computer use (per dev.meta.ai). Independent extraction of clearly attributable benchmark numbers for this exact variant was not sufficiently reliable in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Listed in local metadata as `meta/muse-wonder-full-1.0`; access described as Muse Code subscription (Power/Maximum plans) on Meta’s model page. No confirmed OpenCode Zen Free ID (`noFreeId`).
- **Release / knowledge:** No verified public release date or knowledge cutoff extracted in this pass.
- **IDs:** `meta/muse-wonder-full-1.0` (local metadata).
- **Context window:** 1M total (Meta model page/local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, images, audio, video in; text out (local metadata). Meta page emphasizes multimodal/computer-use capabilities.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Access via Muse Code subscription plans per Meta model page (Power/Maximum); not token-priced like standard API in the reviewed page text.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary Meta model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed in reviewed sources.

